<title>HONG KONG: San Miguel HK parent abandons privatisation.</title>
<headline>San Miguel HK parent abandons privatisation.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>San Miguel Brewery Hong Kong Ltd said on Friday its controlling shareholder, Neptunia Corp Ltd, had abandoned its proposal to privatise the company after the privatisation price proposed by Neptunia was deemed too low.</p>
</text>
